# Shell scripts execute under bash/sh in the Linux Session Runtime container,
# and package-data (`tools/*.sh`, docker scripts) is copied into the wheel and
# image verbatim from the working tree. A CRLF checkout on a Windows host
# (core.autocrlf=true, the Git for Windows default) therefore ships CRLF
# scripts that bash cannot parse — `$'\r': command not found` — blocking every
# ticket run (F-12). Force LF regardless of host git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
